----------
scriptunit-fragment 1
----------

var b = 125

----------
scriptunit-fragment 2
----------

set b = 500

----------
scriptunit-fragment 3
----------

set b = b + 1

----------
scriptunit-fragment 4
----------

let c = b * 2

----------
scriptunit-fragment 5
----------

set b = 0

----------
expect all five units are entered
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | compiles, runs | new | `b` = 0 |
| 2 | overwrites `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | - |
| 3 | updates `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | - |
| 4 | reads `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `c` = 1002 |
| 5 | overwrites `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | - |

----------
scriptunit-edit 4
----------

let c = b * 3

----------
expect unit 4 is edited
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | untouched | unit 2 overwrites `b` after it | `b` = 0 |
| 2 | overwrites `b` (1) | reruns | rerun: unit 4 reads `b`, which unit 5 overwrote after it, and unit 2 is the nearest to set it without reading it | - |
| 3 | updates `b` (1) | reruns | rerun: updates `b` from unit 2, which reran | - |
| 4 | reads `b` (1) | recompiles, runs | edited | `c` = 1503 |
| 5 | overwrites `b` (1) | reruns | rerun: overwrites `b` after unit 4 | - |
